::  modules/comlink/vantage/glow/fold-husk-editor.glow -- Husk Editor!
/-  compiler-shapes
/!  32768
|%
++  gate-husk-editor-bounds
  |=  [cards=@ud permille=@ud]                          ::  <=32 & ==1000
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  verified cards
  ~|  'vantage-husk-editor-card-or-permille-breach'     ::  bounded editor
  ?>  &(lte(cards 32) eql(permille 1000))
  cards
--
